1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,080
Bugungi videoda nima haqida gaplashamiz? Sabablarini aytamiz.

2
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:09,580
Sahna 1: Yomgʻir oldidan suhbat / Yomgʻir boshlanishidan oldingi suhbat

3
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:13,220
Osmon qorayib ketdi-ku.

4
00:00:13,243 --> 00:00:15,221
Rostdan ham.

5
00:00:15,244 --> 00:00:18,644
Qora bulutlar juda koʻp.

6
00:00:18,667 --> 00:00:21,236
Yomgʻir yogʻadi, albatta.

7
00:00:21,259 --> 00:00:22,625
Ha.

8
00:00:22,648 --> 00:00:25,015
Soyaboningiz bormi?

9
00:00:25,038 --> 00:00:27,723
Yoʻq, yoʻq.

10
00:00:27,747 --> 00:00:31,113
Unda, mening soyabonim ostiga kirib oling.

11
00:00:31,136 --> 00:00:33,221
Rahmat.

12
00:00:33,244 --> 00:00:37,878
Menda katta soyabon bor, hech qisiqmaymiz.

13
00:00:37,902 --> 00:00:39,950
Siz juda mehribon ekansiz.

14
00:00:39,973 --> 00:00:42,866
Yoʻq, hech narsa emas.

15
00:00:42,889 --> 00:00:46,622
Shamol ham kuchayib ketdi.

16
00:00:46,645 --> 00:00:48,887
Ha, rost.

17
00:00:48,911 --> 00:00:51,247
Sovuq ham ketdi.

18
00:00:51,270 --> 00:00:53,046
Tezroq boring.

19
00:00:53,070 --> 00:00:55,727
Ha, boramiz.

20
00:00:55,750 --> 00:00:58,022
Vokzalgacha yuguraylikmi?

21
00:00:58,046 --> 00:01:01,324
Xavfli, piyoda boring.

22
00:01:01,347 --> 00:01:03,080
Tushunarli.

23
00:01:03,103 --> 00:01:06,636
Yomgʻir yogʻayapti.

24
00:01:06,659 --> 00:01:09,326
Tezroq soyabon ochaylik.

25
00:01:09,349 --> 00:01:11,082
Iltimos.

26
00:01:11,105 --> 00:01:13,706
Yukingiz joyida turibdi, oʻngmi?

27
00:01:13,730 --> 00:01:18,063
Sumkam hoʻl boʻlib ketishi mumkin, oldinga olaman.

28
00:01:18,086 --> 00:01:20,130
Men koʻtarib olaman.

29
00:01:20,154 --> 00:01:22,087
Yaxshi, rahmat.

30
00:01:22,110 --> 00:01:24,077
Shundaymi?

31
00:01:24,100 --> 00:01:27,834
Momaqaldiroq ovozi eshitilmoqda.

32
00:01:27,857 --> 00:01:29,823
Qoʻrqinchli ekan.

33
00:01:29,846 --> 00:01:33,302
Yaqin atrofdagi kafega kirib olsak?

34
00:01:33,326 --> 00:01:34,959
Yaxshi fikr.

35
00:01:34,982 --> 00:01:38,982
Yomgʻir kuchli, biroz dam olamiz.

36
00:01:39,005 --> 00:01:42,606
Burchakda yangi kafe bor.

37
00:01:42,629 --> 00:01:44,363
Ana u yerda, shu yerda.

38
00:01:44,386 --> 00:01:46,596
Ha, boramiz.

39
00:01:46,619 --> 00:01:55,628
Bugungi videoning skriptini tavsifdan va eng yaxshi kommentdan yuklab olishingiz mumkin. Yuklashdan oldin izoh qoldirishni unutmang.

40
00:01:55,628 --> 00:01:57,128
Sahna 2: Kiyim tanlash va narxlarni solishtirish / Kiyim tanlash va narxlarni taqqoslash

41
00:01:57,128 --> 00:02:00,168
Bu kiyim qanday?

42
00:02:00,192 --> 00:02:02,458
Yaxshi fikr.

43
00:02:02,481 --> 00:02:06,966
Qizil va koʻk futbolkalar bor.

44
00:02:06,990 --> 00:02:09,590
Qaysi biri yoqadi?

45
00:02:09,613 --> 00:02:13,979
Menga qizil futbolka yoqadi.

46
00:02:14,002 --> 00:02:16,569
Sizga juda yaxshi tushadi.

47
00:02:16,592 --> 00:02:18,662
Rahmat.

48
00:02:18,686 --> 00:02:21,019
Sotib olasizmi?

49
00:02:21,042 --> 00:02:25,775
Bir oz qimmat, shuning uchun ikkilanyapman.

50
00:02:25,798 --> 00:02:27,599
Qancha turadi?

51
00:02:27,622 --> 00:02:30,092
Ellik ming soʻm.

52
00:02:30,116 --> 00:02:33,082
Bir oz qimmat ekan.

53
00:02:33,105 --> 00:02:37,379
Ko'k ko'ylak uch ming yen.

54
00:02:37,403 --> 00:02:39,271
Arzon ekan!

55
00:02:39,295 --> 00:02:40,928
Ha.

56
00:02:40,951 --> 00:02:45,320
Lekin, qizil ko'ylak chiroyliroq.

57
00:02:45,344 --> 00:02:48,177
Men ham shunday deb o'ylayman.

58
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:51,835
Unda, qizil ko'ylakni olaylik.

59
00:02:51,858 --> 00:02:56,346
Lekin pulim yo'q, shuning uchun ola olmayman.

60
00:02:56,370 --> 00:02:58,403
Qarz beraymi?

61
00:02:58,426 --> 00:03:01,159
Rostdanmi, yaxshimi?

62
00:03:01,182 --> 00:03:04,618
Ha, muammo yo'q.

63
00:03:04,642 --> 00:03:06,409
Kechirasiz.

64
00:03:06,432 --> 00:03:08,665
O'ylamang.

65
00:03:08,688 --> 00:03:12,359
Keyingi oy albatta qaytaraman.

66
00:03:12,383 --> 00:03:14,949
Sekinroq bo'lsin, muammo emas.

67
00:03:14,972 --> 00:03:16,739
Rahmat.

68
00:03:16,762 --> 00:03:20,377
Yana nimadir kerakmi?

69
00:03:20,401 --> 00:03:25,620
Oyoq kiyimlarim eski, yangi oyoq kiyim xohlayman.

70
00:03:25,644 --> 00:03:27,977
Oyoq kiyim do'koniga ham qaraylikmi?

71
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:30,733
Ha, borishni xohlayman.

72
00:03:30,756 --> 00:03:34,489
U yerda katta oyoq kiyim do'koni bor.

73
00:03:34,512 --> 00:03:36,389
Boraylik.

74
00:03:36,413 --> 00:03:43,518
Bugungi videodagi mashqlarni takrorlash uchun sayt havolasi tavsif va eng yuqori kommentda bor. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan o'chirilishi mumkin.

75
00:03:43,518 --> 00:03:45,018
Sahna 3: Kinoga taklif va rad etish / Kinoga taklif va rad javobi

76
00:03:45,018 --> 00:03:48,452
Navbatdagi shanba bo'shmisiz?

77
00:03:48,475 --> 00:03:50,678
Shanbami?

78
00:03:50,702 --> 00:03:52,271
Ha.

79
00:03:52,294 --> 00:03:54,311
Nima bor?

80
00:03:54,334 --> 00:03:58,192
Ikki dona kino chiptasi oldim.

81
00:03:58,216 --> 00:04:00,185
Kino?

82
00:04:00,208 --> 00:04:02,042
Ha.

83
00:04:02,066 --> 00:04:05,236
Yangi jangari film.

84
00:04:05,260 --> 00:04:07,066
Yaxshi fikr.

85
00:04:07,089 --> 00:04:10,531
Birga ko'ramizmi?

86
00:04:10,554 --> 00:04:15,554
Borishni xohlayman, lekin shanba biroz qiyin.

87
00:04:15,577 --> 00:04:17,511
Shundaymi?

88
00:04:17,534 --> 00:04:21,348
Ishim bor, borolmayman.

89
00:04:21,371 --> 00:04:23,971
Soat nechagacha?

90
00:04:23,994 --> 00:04:26,927
Kechki sakkizgacha.

91
00:04:26,950 --> 00:04:29,529
Afsuski.

92
00:04:29,552 --> 00:04:32,288
Rostdan kechirasiz.

93
00:04:32,312 --> 00:04:35,045
Yakshanba qanday?

94
00:04:35,068 --> 00:04:38,201
Yakshanba dam olish kunim.

95
00:04:38,224 --> 00:04:41,500
Unda, yakshanbaga qoldiramiz.

96
00:04:41,524 --> 00:04:45,207
Chipta shanba kuniga tegishlimi?

97
00:04:45,231 --> 00:04:49,270
Yo'q, istalgan vaqtda ko'rish mumkin.

98
00:04:49,294 --> 00:04:51,494
Shundaymi?

99
00:04:51,517 --> 00:04:54,950
Yakshanba soat 1 da qanday?

100
00:04:54,973 --> 00:04:57,976
O'sha vaqtda bo'lishim mumkin.

101
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:00,633
Yaxshi bo'ldi.

102
00:05:00,656 --> 00:05:03,099
Kutib qolaman.

103
00:05:03,122 --> 00:05:06,764
Kino keyin ovqatlanamizmi?

104
00:05:06,788 --> 00:05:08,755
Yaxshi fikr.

105
00:05:08,778 --> 00:05:14,421
Mazali italyancha taomlar bor restoranni bilaman, u yerga boramiz.

106
00:05:14,444 --> 00:05:16,778
Xursandman.

107
00:05:16,801 --> 00:05:21,810
Unda, yakshanba kuni soat 12:30 da vokzalda uchrashamiz.

108
00:05:21,833 --> 00:05:23,800
Tushunarli.

109
00:05:23,823 --> 00:05:26,429
Kechikmang.

110
00:05:26,452 --> 00:05:28,385
Yaxshi, rahmat.

111
00:05:28,408 --> 00:05:29,908
Sahna 4: Kechikish sabablari va uzr / Kechikish sabablari va uzr so'rash

112
00:05:29,908 --> 00:05:32,342
Kechikdingiz-ku.

113
00:05:32,365 --> 00:05:35,765
Kechikib qoldim, uzr.

114
00:05:35,788 --> 00:05:38,086
Nima bo'ldi?

115
00:05:38,109 --> 00:05:43,743
Yo'l juda tiqilinch edi, avtobuslar harakatlana olmadi.

116
00:05:43,767 --> 00:05:45,767
Baxtsiz hodisa bo'ldimi?

117
00:05:45,790 --> 00:05:49,723
Ha, katta baxtsiz hodisa bo'ldi.

118
00:05:49,746 --> 00:05:52,679
Bu juda yomon bo'libdi.

119
00:05:52,702 --> 00:05:55,472
Rostdan kechirasiz.

120
00:05:55,495 --> 00:05:58,529
Uzoq kutib turdim.

121
00:05:58,552 --> 00:06:00,752
Sovuq bo'ldimi?

122
00:06:00,775 --> 00:06:03,872
Bir oz sovuq edi.

123
00:06:03,895 --> 00:06:07,062
Issiq ichimlik olamiz.

124
00:06:07,085 --> 00:06:08,852
Rahmat.

125
00:06:08,875 --> 00:06:11,041
Kofe bo'ladimi?

126
00:06:11,064 --> 00:06:15,997
Men choy yaxshi ko'raman, iltimos, choy oling.

127
00:06:16,020 --> 00:06:17,867
Tushunarli.

128
00:06:17,891 --> 00:06:21,299
U yerda avtomat bor.

129
00:06:21,323 --> 00:06:23,222
Olib kelaman.

130
00:06:23,245 --> 00:06:25,492
Kutyapman.

131
00:06:25,516 --> 00:06:27,982
Mana, choyingiz.

132
00:06:28,005 --> 00:06:29,772
Rahmat.

133
00:06:29,795 --> 00:06:32,852
Film necha soatda?

134
00:06:32,875 --> 00:06:37,327
Yana 30 daqiqa bor, xavotir olmang.

135
00:06:37,351 --> 00:06:39,524
Yetib olamiz.

136
00:06:39,548 --> 00:06:42,127
Ha, endi tinchlandim.

137
00:06:42,150 --> 00:06:45,550
Keyinroq e'tiborliroq bo'laman.

138
00:06:45,573 --> 00:06:48,573
Ertaroq uydan chiqing.

139
00:06:48,596 --> 00:06:50,366
Shunday qilaman.

140
00:06:50,389 --> 00:06:53,756
Keling, kinoteatrga boring.

141
00:06:53,779 --> 00:06:56,517
Ha, boramiz.

142
00:06:56,540 --> 00:06:59,073
Chiptalar bordingizmi?

143
00:06:59,096 --> 00:07:02,363
Ha, sumkamda.

144
00:07:02,386 --> 00:07:04,794
Yaxshi bo'ldi.

145
00:07:04,818 --> 00:07:06,318
5-SAHNA: Kasallik haqida xabar berish

146
00:07:06,318 --> 00:07:09,328
Allo, xayrli tong.

147
00:07:09,351 --> 00:07:11,641
Xayrli tong.

148
00:07:11,665 --> 00:07:13,515
Kechirasiz.

149
00:07:13,538 --> 00:07:16,829
Bugun maktabga bormayman.

150
00:07:16,853 --> 00:07:18,819
Nima bo'ldi?

151
00:07:18,842 --> 00:07:24,642
Ertalabdan boshlab boshim juda og'riyapti, turolmayapman.

152
00:07:24,665 --> 00:07:27,147
Isitmangiz bormi?

153
00:07:27,171 --> 00:07:30,405
Ha, 38 darajam bor.

154
00:07:30,428 --> 00:07:33,312
Bu juda baland.

155
00:07:33,335 --> 00:07:35,946
Tomog'im ham og'riyapti.

156
00:07:35,970 --> 00:07:38,261
Shifoxonaga borasizmi?

157
00:07:38,284 --> 00:07:41,818
Ha, tushdan keyin shifoxonaga boraman.

158
00:07:41,841 --> 00:07:45,641
Gripp bo'lishi mumkin.

159
00:07:45,664 --> 00:07:47,430
Bilmayman.

160
00:07:47,453 --> 00:07:49,908
Dori ichdingizmi?

161
00:07:49,931 --> 00:07:55,627
Hali shifoxonaga bormadim, shifoxona dori-darmoni yo'q.

162
00:07:55,651 --> 00:07:57,784
Shundaymi?

163
00:07:57,807 --> 00:08:00,505
Uyimdagi dori ichdim.

164
00:08:00,529 --> 00:08:03,699
Yaxshisi, bir oz uxlasangiz.

165
00:08:03,722 --> 00:08:06,156
Ha, shunday qilaman.

166
00:08:06,179 --> 00:08:09,179
Bugungi testni qanday qilamiz?

167
00:08:09,202 --> 00:08:11,735
O'qituvchiga qo'ng'iroq qilaman.

168
00:08:11,758 --> 00:08:15,034
Men o'qituvchiga aytib qo'yaymi?

169
00:08:15,058 --> 00:08:16,698
Iltimos.

170
00:08:16,721 --> 00:08:19,209
Yaxshi, o'zim qilaman.

171
00:08:19,233 --> 00:08:21,234
Rahmat.

172
00:08:21,257 --> 00:08:23,824
Yaxshi dam oling.

173
00:08:23,847 --> 00:08:26,783
Ehtimol, ertaga ham dam olaman.

174
00:08:26,806 --> 00:08:29,865
Iltimos, zoʻrlamang.

175
00:08:29,888 --> 00:08:31,778
Siz juda mehribon ekansiz.

176
00:08:31,802 --> 00:08:34,881
Tezroq sogʻayib ketishingizni tilayman.

177
00:08:34,904 --> 00:08:37,159
Ha, raxmat.

178
00:08:37,183 --> 00:08:40,023
Yaxshi, ertaga koʻrishamiz.

179
00:08:40,046 --> 00:08:42,129
Kechirasiz.

180
00:08:42,153 --> 00:08:43,653
6-SAHNA: VAQT TEJASH UCHUN QULAY TRANSPORTNI TANLASH

181
00:08:43,653 --> 00:08:46,304
Allaqachon soat sakkiz ekan-ku.

182
00:08:46,328 --> 00:08:49,261
Ha, shoshilaylik.

183
00:08:49,284 --> 00:08:52,418
Ofisga nimada boramiz?

184
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:55,207
Odatda elektr poyezdda boraman.

185
00:08:55,230 --> 00:08:58,499
Endi piyoda stansiyagacha boramizmi?

186
00:08:58,523 --> 00:09:02,990
Stansiya uzoq, vaqt ketadi.

187
00:09:03,013 --> 00:09:05,222
Avtobusga chiqsak?

188
00:09:05,246 --> 00:09:08,379
Avtobus ham vaqt oladi.

189
00:09:08,402 --> 00:09:12,675
Vaqti yoʻq, taksida boring.

190
00:09:12,699 --> 00:09:14,266
Ha, rost.

191
00:09:14,289 --> 00:09:16,922
Taksi chaqiramizmi?

192
00:09:16,945 --> 00:09:19,552
Ana u yerda taksi turibdi.

193
00:09:19,576 --> 00:09:21,448
Qoʻlimizni koʻtaraylik.

194
00:09:21,471 --> 00:09:23,838
Toʻxtadi-ku!

195
00:09:23,861 --> 00:09:25,327
Minamiz.

196
00:09:25,350 --> 00:09:28,384
A, eshik ochildi-ku!

197
00:09:28,407 --> 00:09:30,540
Ofisgacha yetkazib qoʻying.

198
00:09:30,563 --> 00:09:32,649
Yetib boramizmi?

199
00:09:32,672 --> 00:09:36,246
Yoʻl boʻsh, muammo yoʻq.

200
00:09:36,270 --> 00:09:38,003
Yaxshi bo'ldi.

201
00:09:38,026 --> 00:09:41,193
Odatda nechada uydan chiqasiz?

202
00:09:41,216 --> 00:09:43,226
Soat yettida.

203
00:09:43,249 --> 00:09:45,783
Bugun uxlab qoldingizmi?

204
00:09:45,806 --> 00:09:47,289
Ha.

205
00:09:47,312 --> 00:09:50,512
Kecha kechgacha uygʻotdim.

206
00:09:50,535 --> 00:09:52,869
Nima qilyapsiz edi?

207
00:09:52,892 --> 00:09:55,309
Film koʻryapman.

208
00:09:55,333 --> 00:09:57,425
Qiziqarli edi-mi?

209
00:09:57,448 --> 00:10:02,332
Juda qiziqarli edi, shuning uchun oxirigacha koʻrdim.

210
00:10:02,356 --> 00:10:04,646
Bugun erta uxlang.

211
00:10:04,670 --> 00:10:07,036
Ha, shunday qilaman.

212
00:10:07,059 --> 00:10:10,326
A, ofisga yetib keldik-ku!

213
00:10:10,349 --> 00:10:12,435
Tez ekan-ku!

214
00:10:12,459 --> 00:10:15,145
Taksi juda qulay ekan.

215
00:10:15,168 --> 00:10:16,668
7-SAHNA: KARRI TANLASH VA YEYISH UCHUN YURISH

216
00:10:16,668 --> 00:10:19,739
Qorni ochdi-ku!

217
00:10:19,763 --> 00:10:22,897
Ha, biror narsa yeyish kerak.

218
00:10:22,920 --> 00:10:25,287
Nima yeysiz?

219
00:10:25,310 --> 00:10:28,944
Men karri yeyishni xohlayman.

220
00:10:28,967 --> 00:10:32,033
Karri? Yaxshi fikr!

221
00:10:32,056 --> 00:10:36,456
Achchiq taomlarni yaxshi koʻraman, shuning uchun tez-tez yeyman.

222
00:10:36,479 --> 00:10:39,285
Qaysi doʻkonga boramiz?

223
00:10:39,309 --> 00:10:44,042
Stansiya oldida yangi hind oshxonasi ochilgan.

224
00:10:44,065 --> 00:10:47,798
U yerda karri mazali-mi?

225
00:10:47,821 --> 00:10:51,036
Doʻstlarim mazali ekanligini aytishdi.

226
00:10:51,060 --> 00:10:53,027
Borib koʻraylik.

227
00:10:53,050 --> 00:10:55,816
Piyoda boramizmi?

228
00:10:55,839 --> 00:10:58,573
Yaqin ekan, piyoda boring.

229
00:10:58,596 --> 00:11:01,996
Menyuda koʻp tanlovlar bor ekan.

230
00:11:02,019 --> 00:11:05,152
Men tovuq karri tanlayman.

231
00:11:05,175 --> 00:11:08,822
Men sabzavot karri tanlayman.

232
00:11:08,845 --> 00:11:11,618
Ichimlik nima qilamiz?

233
00:11:11,642 --> 00:11:15,893
Achchiq ekan, sovuq suv ichmoqchiman.

234
00:11:15,916 --> 00:11:19,650
Men shirin sharbat ichaman.

235
00:11:19,673 --> 00:11:25,206
Doʻstlarimning aytishicha, bu yerda non ham juda mazali ekan.

236
00:11:25,229 --> 00:11:28,429
Unda, non ham buyurtma qilaylik.

237
00:11:28,452 --> 00:11:31,319
Guruch ham yeysizmi?

238
00:11:31,343 --> 00:11:36,110
Men qorni och ekanman, shuning uchun guruch ham yeyman.

239
00:11:36,133 --> 00:11:38,333
Koʻp yeysiz-ku!

240
00:11:38,356 --> 00:11:41,956
Ha, ovqat yeyishni yaxshi koʻraman.

241
00:11:41,979 --> 00:11:44,579
Men ham xuddi shunday.

242
00:11:44,602 --> 00:11:46,970
Taomlar keldi-ku!

243
00:11:46,993 --> 00:11:48,770
Yeyishni boshlaymiz!

244
00:11:48,793 --> 00:11:51,467
Haqiqatan ham juda mazali ekan!

245
00:11:51,491 --> 00:11:54,624
Ha, yana kelamiz.

246
00:11:54,647 --> 00:11:58,344
Keyin boshqa karri turini sinab koʻrmoqchiman.

247
00:11:58,368 --> 00:12:00,376
Ha, rost.

248
00:12:00,400 --> 00:12:01,900
8-Sahna: Dam olish kunidagi tennis / Dam olish kunida tennis mashgʻulotlari

249
00:12:01,900 --> 00:12:05,666
Dam olish kunlarida nima qilasiz?

250
00:12:05,689 --> 00:12:07,823
Tennis oʻynayman.

251
00:12:07,845 --> 00:12:10,891
Har hafta tennis oʻynaysizmi?

252
00:12:10,914 --> 00:12:15,085
Ha, har yakshanba kuni boraman.

253
00:12:15,109 --> 00:12:17,392
Tennisni yoqtirasizmi?

254
00:12:17,416 --> 00:12:21,582
Juda qiziqarli, shuning uchun juda yoqadi.

255
00:12:21,605 --> 00:12:24,296
Qayerda tennis oʻynaysiz?

256
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:27,853
Yaqin atrofdagi bogʻda kort bor.

257
00:12:27,876 --> 00:12:30,409
Kim bilan oʻynaysiz?

258
00:12:30,432 --> 00:12:32,968
Doʻstlarim bilan oʻynayman.

259
00:12:32,991 --> 00:12:35,325
Yaxshi fikr.

260
00:12:35,348 --> 00:12:39,791
Sport stressni yoʻqotishga yordam beradi, juda yaxshi.

261
00:12:39,814 --> 00:12:43,581
Men ham biror sport turi bilan shugʻullanmoqchiman.

262
00:12:43,604 --> 00:12:47,137
Yoqtirgan sport turingiz bormi?

263
00:12:47,160 --> 00:12:50,727
Men suzishni yaxshi koʻraman.

264
00:12:50,750 --> 00:12:53,716
Unda, basseyn haqida nima deyishsiz?

265
00:12:53,739 --> 00:12:58,237
Hozir qish ekan, suvi sovuq.

266
00:12:58,261 --> 00:13:01,027
Yopiq basseyn bor-ku.

267
00:13:01,050 --> 00:13:03,490
Bu juda yaxshi.

268
00:13:03,514 --> 00:13:07,354
Issiq ekan, juda yoqimli boʻladi.

269
00:13:07,377 --> 00:13:10,581
Keyingi dam olish kunida basseynaga boraman.

270
00:13:10,605 --> 00:13:12,971
Yolgʻiz borasizmi?

271
00:13:12,994 --> 00:13:15,733
Singlim bilan boraman.

272
00:13:15,757 --> 00:13:19,230
Singlingiz ham suzishni yaxshi koʻradi-mi?

273
00:13:19,254 --> 00:13:25,820
Ha, singlim suzishni oʻrganadi, juda yaxshi suzadi.

274
00:13:25,843 --> 00:13:28,058
Ajoyib ekan!

275
00:13:28,082 --> 00:13:32,701
Suzgandan keyin doimo mazali narsa yeymiz.

276
00:13:32,724 --> 00:13:35,324
Nima yeysiz?

277
00:13:35,347 --> 00:13:38,313
Issiq ramen yeymiz.

278
00:13:38,336 --> 00:13:42,342
Qorni och ekan, ramen juda mazali boʻladi.

279
00:13:42,366 --> 00:13:46,139
Ha, dam olish kunlari juda qiziqarli boʻladi.

280
00:13:46,163 --> 00:13:47,663
9-Sahna: Yapon tili oʻrganish va kelajak orzulari / Yapon tili oʻrganish va kelajakdagi orzular

281
00:13:47,663 --> 00:13:51,429
Yapon tilini o‘rganish qanday?

282
00:13:51,452 --> 00:13:56,252
Kanjilar qiyin, shuning uchun qiyin.

283
00:13:56,275 --> 00:13:59,209
Har kuni o‘qiysizmi?

284
00:13:59,232 --> 00:14:03,867
Har kuni 2 soat o‘qiyman.

285
00:14:03,890 --> 00:14:06,262
Ajoyib!

286
00:14:06,285 --> 00:14:11,118
Yapon kompaniyasida ishlashni xohlayman, shuning uchun harakat qilaman.

287
00:14:11,141 --> 00:14:14,159
Qanday kompaniyaga kirishni xohlaysiz?

288
00:14:14,183 --> 00:14:17,383
Avtomobil kompaniyasiga kirishni xohlayman.

289
00:14:17,406 --> 00:14:20,372
Yapon avtomobillarini yoqtirasizmi?

290
00:14:20,395 --> 00:14:23,929
Chiroyli, shuning uchun juda yoqadi.

291
00:14:23,952 --> 00:14:28,233
Kelajakda Yaponiyada yashaysizmi?

292
00:14:28,256 --> 00:14:32,856
Ha. Yaponiyada xavfsizlik yaxshi, shuning uchun uzoq yashamoqchiman.

293
00:14:32,879 --> 00:14:35,617
Oziq-ovqat ham juda mazali.

294
00:14:35,641 --> 00:14:38,974
Men sushini ham, ramenni ham juda yaxshi ko‘raman.

295
00:14:38,997 --> 00:14:42,164
Dam olish kunlari nima qilasiz?

296
00:14:42,187 --> 00:14:45,253
Yapon animelarini ko‘raman.

297
00:14:45,276 --> 00:14:48,510
Anime orqali yapon tilini o‘rganasizmi?

298
00:14:48,533 --> 00:14:52,899
Qiziqarli, shuning uchun yaxshi o‘rganish bo‘ladi.

299
00:14:52,922 --> 00:14:56,889
Navbatda birga kino ko‘rishga bormaymizmi?

300
00:14:56,913 --> 00:14:59,208
Qaysi film?

301
00:14:59,231 --> 00:15:02,898
Yangi anime filmi.

302
00:15:02,921 --> 00:15:04,654
Xursandman.

303
00:15:04,677 --> 00:15:06,844
Albatta borishni xohlayman!

304
00:15:06,867 --> 00:15:11,600
Yapon tilini mashq qilish uchun ko‘p gaplashamiz.

305
00:15:11,623 --> 00:15:13,592
Rahmat.

306
00:15:13,616 --> 00:15:17,849
Nimani tushunmagan bo‘lsangiz, so‘rang.

307
00:15:17,872 --> 00:15:21,872
Lug‘at olib boraman, shuning uchun muammo yo‘q.

308
00:15:21,895 --> 00:15:23,628
Shundaymi?

309
00:15:23,651 --> 00:15:25,500
Ajoyibsiz!

310
00:15:25,523 --> 00:15:30,523
Keyingi hafta imtihon ham bor, shuning uchun ko‘proq o‘qiyman.

311
00:15:30,546 --> 00:15:32,746
Sizni qo‘llab-quvvatlayman!

312
00:15:32,769 --> 00:15:35,036
Rahmat.

313
00:15:35,059 --> 00:15:36,559
10-sahna: Sayohat rejalari / Yozgi sayohatni rejalashtirish

314
00:15:36,559 --> 00:15:41,159
Yozgi ta’tilda sayohatga borasizmi?

315
00:15:41,182 --> 00:15:44,787
Ha, sayohatga borishni xohlayman.

316
00:15:44,810 --> 00:15:47,010
Qayerga borishni xohlaysiz?

317
00:15:47,033 --> 00:15:50,768
Tog‘ yoki dengizga borishni xohlayman.

318
00:15:50,792 --> 00:15:53,192
Qaysi biri yaxshiroq?

319
00:15:53,215 --> 00:15:58,066
Issiq, shuning uchun salqin tog‘ yaxshiroq.

320
00:15:58,089 --> 00:16:00,023
Yaxshi fikr.

321
00:16:00,046 --> 00:16:02,879
Xokkaydo qanday?

322
00:16:02,902 --> 00:16:08,478
Xokkaydo uzoq, shuning uchun samolyot chiptasi qimmat.

323
00:16:08,501 --> 00:16:11,668
Unda, Xakone qanday?

324
00:16:11,691 --> 00:16:14,709
Xakone yaxshi.

325
00:16:14,733 --> 00:16:19,500
Issiq buloqlar bor, shuning uchun dam olish mumkin.

326
00:16:19,524 --> 00:16:25,891
Issiq buloqqa tushishni xohlayman, shuning uchun oldin internetda ko‘rgan mehmonxonaga boramiz.

327
00:16:25,914 --> 00:16:28,347
Qaysi mehmonxona?

328
00:16:28,370 --> 00:16:32,587
Tog‘ ichidagi eski mehmonxona.

329
00:16:32,611 --> 00:16:34,944
Qimmat emasmi?

330
00:16:34,967 --> 00:16:39,235
Internet orqali bron qilsak, arzon.

331
00:16:39,258 --> 00:16:41,692
Bu juda yaxshi.

332
00:16:41,715 --> 00:16:45,153
Oziq-ovqat ham mazali ekan.

333
00:16:45,177 --> 00:16:48,033
Qanday taomlar bo‘ladi?

334
00:16:48,056 --> 00:16:52,691
Ko‘p baliq taomlari bo‘ladi ekan.

335
00:16:52,714 --> 00:16:56,997
Men baliqni yaxshi ko‘raman, shuning uchun xursandman.

336
00:16:57,021 --> 00:16:59,354
Qachondan boramiz?

337
00:16:59,377 --> 00:17:03,115
Kelgusi oy beshinchi kundan boraylik.

338
00:17:03,138 --> 00:17:05,272
Uch kunmi?

339
00:17:05,295 --> 00:17:09,742
Dam olish kunlari qisqa, shuning uchun ikki kun.

340
00:17:09,765 --> 00:17:12,032
Tushunarli.

341
00:17:12,055 --> 00:17:15,121
Poyezd chiptasini ham sotib olamizmi?

342
00:17:15,144 --> 00:17:18,923
Band boʻladi, shuning uchun tezroq sotib olaylik.

343
00:17:18,947 --> 00:17:21,434
Bugun stansiyada sotib olaman.

344
00:17:21,457 --> 00:17:23,391
Iltimos.

345
00:17:23,414 --> 00:17:26,682
Sayohatni intiqlik bilan kutmoqdaman.

346
00:17:26,705 --> 00:17:30,197
Men ham juda intiqlik bilan kutmoqdaman.

347
00:17:30,221 --> 00:17:31,721
11-SAHNA: PASPORTNI YO‘QOTGAN HOLDA / Yo‘qolgan pasport bilan kurashish

348
00:17:31,721 --> 00:17:34,121
Nima bo'ldi?

349
00:17:34,144 --> 00:17:37,436
Pasportimni topolmadim.

350
00:17:37,459 --> 00:17:40,459
Eee, rostmi?

351
00:17:40,482 --> 00:17:44,731
Ha, sumkamda yoʻq.

352
00:17:44,755 --> 00:17:47,488
Choʻntagingizda bormi?

353
00:17:47,511 --> 00:17:50,409
Choʻntaklarni ham qidirdim.

354
00:17:50,433 --> 00:17:52,713
Lekin yoʻq.

355
00:17:52,736 --> 00:17:55,474
Qayerda yoʻqotdingiz?

356
00:17:55,498 --> 00:17:57,746
Bilmayman.

357
00:17:57,770 --> 00:18:01,003
Bugun qayerlarga bordingiz?

358
00:18:01,026 --> 00:18:03,793
Bankka bordim.

359
00:18:03,816 --> 00:18:06,902
Keyinroq qayerga bordingiz?

360
00:18:06,926 --> 00:18:10,326
Univermagda xarid qildim.

361
00:18:10,349 --> 00:18:14,515
Univermag hojatxonasiga bordingizmi?

362
00:18:14,538 --> 00:18:17,738
Ha, hojatxonaga bordim.

363
00:18:17,761 --> 00:18:21,328
Ehtimol, u yerda unutgansiz.

364
00:18:21,351 --> 00:18:23,484
Ha, rost.

365
00:18:23,507 --> 00:18:26,907
Univermagga qoʻngʻiroq qilaylikmi?

366
00:18:26,930 --> 00:18:29,764
Ha, iltimos.

367
00:18:29,786 --> 00:18:31,786
Allo?

368
00:18:31,809 --> 00:18:35,696
Yo‘qolgan pasport topilmadimi?

369
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:38,199
… A, shundaymi.

370
00:18:38,223 --> 00:18:39,990
Tushunarli.

371
00:18:40,013 --> 00:18:42,086
Topildimi?

372
00:18:42,109 --> 00:18:44,920
Yo‘q, topilmagan ekan.

373
00:18:44,944 --> 00:18:47,119
Muammoga duch keldik.

374
00:18:47,142 --> 00:18:50,309
Indinga davlatga qaytishim kerak.

375
00:18:50,332 --> 00:18:53,108
Bu juda jiddiy masala.

376
00:18:53,131 --> 00:18:55,931
Politsiyaga boraylikmi?

377
00:18:55,954 --> 00:18:57,388
Ha, rost.

378
00:18:57,411 --> 00:18:59,883
Birga boramiz.

379
00:18:59,906 --> 00:19:01,873
Kechirasiz.

380
00:19:01,896 --> 00:19:03,729
Rahmat.

381
00:19:03,752 --> 00:19:06,919
A, biroz kutib turing.

382
00:19:06,942 --> 00:19:09,142
Nima bo'ldi?

383
00:19:09,165 --> 00:19:13,498
Palto choʻntagingiz biroz boʻrtib turibdi.

384
00:19:13,521 --> 00:19:16,254
A, rostdan ham.

385
00:19:16,277 --> 00:19:18,519
A, topildi!

386
00:19:18,542 --> 00:19:20,309
Pasport ekan.

387
00:19:20,332 --> 00:19:23,827
Palto choʻntagida ekan-ku.

388
00:19:23,851 --> 00:19:27,884
Ha, rostini aytsam, uzr.

389
00:19:27,907 --> 00:19:29,684
Yaxshi bo'ldi.

390
00:19:29,708 --> 00:19:31,641
Xafaligim ketdi.

391
00:19:31,664 --> 00:19:33,164
12-SAHNA: IZAKAYAGA TAXRIRLASH / Izakayaga taklif

392
00:19:33,164 --> 00:19:37,807
Bu juma vaqtingiz bormi?

393
00:19:37,831 --> 00:19:41,664
Juma, kechasi deysizmi?

394
00:19:41,687 --> 00:19:45,620
Ha, ishdan keyin.

395
00:19:45,643 --> 00:19:48,477
Nima bor?

396
00:19:48,500 --> 00:19:53,304
Hammamiz yangi izakayaga boramiz.

397
00:19:53,327 --> 00:19:55,527
Yaxshi fikr.

398
00:19:55,550 --> 00:19:58,124
Birga boramizmi?

399
00:19:58,148 --> 00:20:04,514
Borishni xohlardim, lekin juma kuni biroz rejam bor.

400
00:20:04,537 --> 00:20:08,548
Shundaymi, qoʻshimcha ishlayapsizmi?

401
00:20:08,572 --> 00:20:13,405
Yoʻq, onam uyga keladi.

402
00:20:13,428 --> 00:20:15,527
Onangizmi?

403
00:20:15,551 --> 00:20:20,353
Ha, qishloqdan mehmonga keladi.

404
00:20:20,377 --> 00:20:23,270
Bu juda qiziqarli boʻladi-ku.

405
00:20:23,293 --> 00:20:28,060
Ha, birga ovqatlanamiz.

406
00:20:28,083 --> 00:20:31,887
Demak, juma kuni boʻlmaydi-ku.

407
00:20:31,911 --> 00:20:35,077
Rostdan kechirasiz.

408
00:20:35,100 --> 00:20:37,702
O'ylamang.

409
00:20:37,726 --> 00:20:40,696
Keyinroq yana taklif qiling.

410
00:20:40,719 --> 00:20:43,157
Shanba kuni qanday?

411
00:20:43,181 --> 00:20:49,181
Shanba kuni onam bilan xarid qilishga boramiz.

412
00:20:49,204 --> 00:20:51,637
Yakshanba kuni qanday?

413
00:20:51,660 --> 00:20:57,393
Yakshanba kuni onam ketadi, shuning uchun muammo yoʻq.

414
00:20:57,416 --> 00:21:02,183
Unda, yakshanba kuni kino koʻrishga boramizmi?

415
00:21:02,206 --> 00:21:04,648
Kino?

416
00:21:04,672 --> 00:21:08,441
Qiziqarli film koʻrsatilmoqda.

417
00:21:08,464 --> 00:21:11,797
Yaxshi, boramiz.

418
00:21:11,820 --> 00:21:15,688
Unda, yakshanba kuni tushdan keyin boʻlsin.

419
00:21:15,711 --> 00:21:17,645
Tushunarli.

420
00:21:17,668 --> 00:21:20,334
Kutib qolaman.

421
00:21:20,357 --> 00:21:24,524
Onangiz bilan ovqatlanishdan zavqlaning.

422
00:21:24,547 --> 00:21:26,837
Rahmat.

423
00:21:26,861 --> 00:21:28,361
13-SAHNA: Kechikish haqida xabar berish

424
00:21:28,361 --> 00:21:31,966
Allo, xayrli tong.

425
00:21:31,990 --> 00:21:34,356
Xayrli tong.

426
00:21:34,379 --> 00:21:36,913
Hozir qayerdasiz?

427
00:21:36,936 --> 00:21:40,169
Hozir stansiyada turibman.

428
00:21:40,192 --> 00:21:43,968
Kompaniya ish boshlashiga oz qoldi-ku.

429
00:21:43,991 --> 00:21:48,258
Kechirasiz, biroz kechikaman.

430
00:21:48,281 --> 00:21:50,737
Nima bo'ldi?

431
00:21:50,760 --> 00:21:56,374
Poyezd kechikdi, shuning uchun oʻn daqiqa kechikaman.

432
00:21:56,398 --> 00:21:58,431
Baxtsiz hodisa bo'ldimi?

433
00:21:58,454 --> 00:22:04,787
Ha, katta baxtsiz hodisa boʻlgani uchun poyezd toʻxtadi.

434
00:22:04,810 --> 00:22:08,777
Bu juda yomon ekan-ku.

435
00:22:08,800 --> 00:22:12,167
Hozir taksida boraman.

436
00:22:12,190 --> 00:22:15,860
Taksilar ham gavjum boʻlishi mumkin deb oʻylayman.

437
00:22:15,884 --> 00:22:22,051
Stansiya oldida juda koʻp odam bor, shuning uchun minolmay qolishim mumkin.

438
00:22:22,074 --> 00:22:25,013
Stansiyadan piyoda boraman.

439
00:22:25,036 --> 00:22:28,203
Zoʻr bermang.

440
00:22:28,226 --> 00:22:30,792
Yugurma.

441
00:22:30,815 --> 00:22:34,187
Ha, ehtiyot boʻlaman.

442
00:22:34,211 --> 00:22:37,030
Yigʻilish soat nechada boshlanadi?

443
00:22:37,054 --> 00:22:42,787
Yigʻilish soat oʻn da boshlanadi, shuning uchun muammo yoʻq.

444
00:22:42,810 --> 00:22:45,044
Yaxshi bo'ldi.

445
00:22:45,067 --> 00:22:46,700
Xafaligim ketdi.

446
00:22:46,723 --> 00:22:49,941
Shoshilmang ham.

447
00:22:49,965 --> 00:22:53,022
Rostdan ham uzr.

448
00:22:53,045 --> 00:22:57,724
Hech kimning aybi emas, xavotir olmang.

449
00:22:57,747 --> 00:22:59,480
Rahmat.

450
00:22:59,503 --> 00:23:03,042
Yoʻlda ehtiyot boʻling.

451
00:23:03,066 --> 00:23:06,843
Ha, iloji boricha tezroq boraman.

452
00:23:06,867 --> 00:23:10,300
Kompaniyaga yetib kelganingizda xabar bering.

453
00:23:10,323 --> 00:23:12,739
Tushunarli.

454
00:23:12,763 --> 00:23:15,059
Iltimos.

455
00:23:15,083 --> 00:23:18,049
Unda, kutamiz.

456
00:23:18,072 --> 00:23:20,407
Kechirasiz.

457
00:23:20,431 --> 00:23:21,931
14-SAHNA: Kasallik haqida xabar berish

458
00:23:21,931 --> 00:23:24,331
Salom.

459
00:23:24,354 --> 00:23:26,687
Salom.

460
00:23:26,710 --> 00:23:28,677
Nima boʻldi?

461
00:23:28,700 --> 00:23:31,507
Ovozingiz oʻzgacha eshitilmoqda.

462
00:23:31,530 --> 00:23:38,930
Aslida, haroratim 38 daraja, shuning uchun bugun dam olaman.

463
00:23:38,953 --> 00:23:41,638
Oʻttiz sakkiz daraja ekanmi?

464
00:23:41,662 --> 00:23:44,307
Bu juda baland.

465
00:23:44,331 --> 00:23:50,427
Ha, yoʻtal ham biroz chiqyapti, tomogʻim ham ogʻriyapti.

466
00:23:50,450 --> 00:23:53,322
Shifoxonaga bordingizmi?

467
00:23:53,346 --> 00:23:56,913
Hozir shifoxonaga boraman.

468
00:23:56,936 --> 00:24:00,903
Yaqinlarda shifoxona bormi?

469
00:24:00,926 --> 00:24:06,597
Bekat oldida yangi shifoxona ochildi, shu yerga boraman.

470
00:24:06,620 --> 00:24:09,257
Yaxshi boʻldi-ku.

471
00:24:09,281 --> 00:24:11,779
Ovqat yeysizmi?

472
00:24:11,802 --> 00:24:16,889
Ishtaha yoʻq, hali hech narsa yemadim.

473
00:24:16,913 --> 00:24:20,479
Shoʻrva ichsangiz yaxshi boʻlardi.

474
00:24:20,502 --> 00:24:24,116
Ha, ozgina ichaman.

475
00:24:24,140 --> 00:24:28,673
Tushdan keyin uchrashuvni bekor qilsam boʻladi-mi?

476
00:24:28,696 --> 00:24:30,630
Yaxshi, rahmat.

477
00:24:30,653 --> 00:24:35,859
Men mijozlarga xabar berib qoʻyaman, xavotir olmang.

478
00:24:35,883 --> 00:24:37,816
Rahmat.

479
00:24:37,839 --> 00:24:40,039
Katta yordam boʻlar edi.

480
00:24:40,062 --> 00:24:42,835
Materiallar qayerda?

481
00:24:42,859 --> 00:24:47,862
Mening stolimda turibdi, qarab qoʻying.

482
00:24:47,885 --> 00:24:49,852
Tushunarli.

483
00:24:49,875 --> 00:24:51,521
Tekshirib qoʻyaman.

484
00:24:51,545 --> 00:24:56,545
Noqulaylik uchun uzr soʻrayman.

485
00:24:56,568 --> 00:25:01,866
Salomatlik eng muhimi, yaxshi dam oling.

486
00:25:01,889 --> 00:25:03,541
Rahmat.

487
00:25:03,564 --> 00:25:08,220
Dori ichib, koʻp uxlang.

488
00:25:08,244 --> 00:25:10,537
Ha, shunday qilaman.

489
00:25:10,561 --> 00:25:13,295
Ertaga kelolasizmi?

490
00:25:13,319 --> 00:25:18,252
Hali bilmayman, kechqurun yana xabar beraman.

491
00:25:18,275 --> 00:25:21,010
Ha, kutaman.

492
00:25:21,034 --> 00:25:23,400
Iltimos.

493
00:25:23,423 --> 00:25:25,623
Tezroq sogʻaying.

494
00:25:25,646 --> 00:25:27,684
Kechirasiz.

495
00:25:27,708 --> 00:25:29,208
15-sahna: Tushlik tanlash va restoran tanlash / Tushlik joyini tanlash va restoran belgilash

496
00:25:29,208 --> 00:25:33,092
Bugun tushlikka qayerga boramiz?

497
00:25:33,115 --> 00:25:35,048
Ha, rost.

498
00:25:35,071 --> 00:25:37,238
Qayer yaxshi boʻladi?

499
00:25:37,261 --> 00:25:40,428
Odatdagi restoranga boramizmi?

500
00:25:40,451 --> 00:25:46,017
U yer ovqati mazali, lekin biroz uzoq.

501
00:25:46,040 --> 00:25:48,810
Rostdan ham piyoda yuramiz.

502
00:25:48,833 --> 00:25:53,834
Bugun yomgʻir yogʻyapti, yaqin joy yaxshi boʻlardi.

503
00:25:53,857 --> 00:25:57,943
Bekat oldidagi italiyalik restoran qanday?

504
00:25:57,967 --> 00:26:01,051
Italiyalik restoran yaxshi boʻlardi.

505
00:26:01,075 --> 00:26:06,108
Bekatdan yaqin, ovqati ham mazali, shu yerga boramiz.

506
00:26:06,131 --> 00:26:10,767
Lekin u yer doimo gavjum boʻladi-ku.

507
00:26:10,790 --> 00:26:16,324
Hozir hali soat oʻn bir yarim, muammo boʻlmaydi deb oʻylayman.

508
00:26:16,347 --> 00:26:17,963
Ha, rost.

509
00:26:17,986 --> 00:26:20,319
Tezroq boramiz.

510
00:26:20,342 --> 00:26:23,109
Menyuda nima yoqadi?

511
00:26:23,132 --> 00:26:26,399
Menga pitsa yoqadi.

512
00:26:26,423 --> 00:26:29,597
Men har doim makaron yeyman.

513
00:26:29,620 --> 00:26:36,820
U yerda pitsa ham katta, pishloq ham koʻp, juda mazali.

514
00:26:36,843 --> 00:26:39,118
Shirinlik ham bor ekan.

515
00:26:39,141 --> 00:26:41,718
Desert ham yeymizmi?

516
00:26:41,741 --> 00:26:47,419
Tushdan keyin koʻp ish bor, shirinlik yeyish kerak.

517
00:26:47,443 --> 00:26:49,176
Yaxshi fikr.

518
00:26:49,199 --> 00:26:51,271
Maqullayman.

519
00:26:51,294 --> 00:26:53,061
Band qilsakmi?

520
00:26:53,085 --> 00:26:56,286
Telefon raqamini bilasizmi?

521
00:26:56,309 --> 00:26:59,776
Ha, internetdan qidirib topdim.

522
00:26:59,799 --> 00:27:02,011
Unda, iltimos qilib qoʻying.

523
00:27:02,034 --> 00:27:07,168
A, internetda koʻrdim, bugun dam olish kuni ekan-ku.

524
00:27:07,191 --> 00:27:10,557
Eee, afsuski.

525
00:27:10,580 --> 00:27:12,955
Nima qilamiz?

526
00:27:12,978 --> 00:27:16,312
Kompaniya yonidagi udon doʻkoni qanday?

527
00:27:16,335 --> 00:27:18,368
Yaxshi fikr.

528
00:27:18,391 --> 00:27:23,438
U yer arzon, tez tayyorlanadi va juda qulay.

529
00:27:23,462 --> 00:27:26,131
Udon ham juda mazali.

530
00:27:26,154 --> 00:27:29,587
Shunda bugun udon yeymiz.

531
00:27:29,610 --> 00:27:31,988
Ha, boramiz.

532
00:27:32,012 --> 00:27:33,512
16-SAHNA: Yangi yarim kunlik ishchi / The New Part-Time Employee

533
00:27:33,512 --> 00:27:37,205
Yangi yarim kunlik ishchi qanday?

534
