Tanaka-san ekan.

535
00:27:39,456 --> 00:27:41,691
Juda yaxshi odam.

536
00:27:41,714 --> 00:27:43,408
Rostdanmi?

537
00:27:43,431 --> 00:27:45,598
Qanday odam?

538
00:27:45,621 --> 00:27:51,021
Jiddiy, mehribon va ajoyib inson.

539
00:27:51,044 --> 00:27:53,419
Yaxshi boʻldi-ku.

540
00:27:53,443 --> 00:27:55,676
Ishlari qanday?

541
00:27:55,699 --> 00:28:01,667
Ishlari tez, puxtalik bilan qilinadi, rostdan ham yordam beradi.

542
00:28:01,691 --> 00:28:03,744
Ajoyib!

543
00:28:03,768 --> 00:28:05,901
Yoshmi?

544
00:28:05,924 --> 00:28:07,357
Ha.

545
00:28:07,380 --> 00:28:09,782
Bu yil yigirma yoshda.

546
00:28:09,806 --> 00:28:11,973
Yosh ekan.

547
00:28:11,996 --> 00:28:14,162
Talabami?

548
00:28:14,185 --> 00:28:15,919
Ha.

549
00:28:15,941 --> 00:28:19,561
Universitetda ingliz tili oʻrganayotgan ekan.

550
00:28:19,585 --> 00:28:22,070
Inglizcha gaplasha oladimi?

551
00:28:22,093 --> 00:28:23,584
Ha.

552
00:28:23,607 --> 00:28:30,261
Inglizcha ham gaplasha oladi, xitoycha ham biroz biladi, juda zoʻr.

553
00:28:30,284 --> 00:28:34,964
Chet ellik mehmonlar kelganida yordam beradi.

554
00:28:34,988 --> 00:28:36,465
Ha.

555
00:28:36,488 --> 00:28:40,171
Kecha ham ingliz mehmoni bilan gaplashayotgan edi.

556
00:28:40,195 --> 00:28:44,804
Tanaka-san allaqachon doʻkonning sevimlisiga aylanganmi?

557
00:28:44,827 --> 00:28:46,261
Ha.

558
00:28:46,284 --> 00:28:52,520
Yorqin, koʻp kuladi, hamma uni yaxshi koʻradi, deb oʻylayman.

559
00:28:52,543 --> 00:28:56,755
Men ham tezroq Tanaka-sanga uchrashmoqchiman.

560
00:28:56,779 --> 00:29:01,114
Ertaga tushdan keyin Tanaka-san ishlaydi.

561
00:29:01,137 --> 00:29:03,204
Shundaymi?

562
00:29:03,227 --> 00:29:06,427
Men ertaga dam olish kunim.

563
00:29:06,450 --> 00:29:09,216
Afsuski.

564
00:29:09,239 --> 00:29:13,239
Indinga Tanaka-san ishlaydimi?

565
00:29:13,262 --> 00:29:14,699
Ha.

566
00:29:14,722 --> 00:29:17,756
Indinga ham ertalabdan ishlaydi.

567
00:29:17,779 --> 00:29:19,836
Yaxshi boʻldi.

568
00:29:19,859 --> 00:29:22,026
Indinga salomlashaman.

569
00:29:22,049 --> 00:29:25,533
Birga tushlik qilamiz.

570
00:29:25,557 --> 00:29:27,362
Yaxshi fikr.

571
00:29:27,386 --> 00:29:31,386
Tanaka-san qanday ovqatni yaxshi koʻradi?

572
00:29:31,409 --> 00:29:34,576
Goʻsht yaxshi koʻradi, dedi.

573
00:29:34,599 --> 00:29:39,565
Shunda vokzal oldidagi gamburger doʻkoniga boramizmi?

574
00:29:39,588 --> 00:29:44,155
U yer mazali, arzon va yaxshi.

575
00:29:44,178 --> 00:29:45,864
Ha.

576
00:29:45,887 --> 00:29:48,620
Tanaka-san ham xursand boʻladi, deb oʻylayman.

577
00:29:48,643 --> 00:29:50,920
Kutishdan xursandman.

578
00:29:50,944 --> 00:29:52,432
Ha.

579
00:29:52,456 --> 00:29:55,323
Tezroq birga ishlashni xohlardim.

580
00:29:55,346 --> 00:30:00,122
Kelajakda yanada band boʻladi, shuning uchun harakat qilaylik.

581
00:30:00,145 --> 00:30:01,645
17-SAHNA: Yangi xonamni tanishtirish / Introducing My New Apartment

582
00:30:01,645 --> 00:30:05,612
Yangi xonani topdingizmi?

583
00:30:05,634 --> 00:30:08,634
Ha, nihoyat topdim.

584
00:30:08,657 --> 00:30:10,751
Qanday xona?

585
00:30:10,775 --> 00:30:16,342
Vokzaldan yaqin, yangi va juda yaxshi xona.

586
00:30:16,365 --> 00:30:19,458
Vokzaldan yaqinligi qulay.

587
00:30:19,482 --> 00:30:22,815
Ha, piyoda besh daqiqa.

588
00:30:22,838 --> 00:30:25,926
Yaqin atrofda doʻkon bormi?

589
00:30:25,949 --> 00:30:31,916
Supermarket ham yaqin, doimiy doʻkon (konbini) ham bor, xarid qilish qulay.

590
00:30:31,939 --> 00:30:34,472
Bu juda zoʻr ekan!

591
00:30:34,495 --> 00:30:37,862
Ha, rostdan ham xursandman.

592
00:30:37,885 --> 00:30:40,518
Xona kengmi?

593
00:30:40,541 --> 00:30:43,112
Oʻrtacha keng.

594
00:30:43,135 --> 00:30:45,269
Ijara qimmatmi?

595
00:30:45,292 --> 00:30:52,258
Yoʻq, ijara arzon, internet ham bepul, foydali.

596
00:30:52,281 --> 00:30:54,340
Ajoyib ekan!

597
00:30:54,363 --> 00:30:56,617
Qayerda joylashgan?

598
00:30:56,641 --> 00:30:59,241
Shinjuku yaqinida.

599
00:30:59,264 --> 00:31:01,864
Ofisdan ham yaqin ekan.

600
00:31:01,887 --> 00:31:05,304
Ha, elektr poyezdda oʻn daqiqa.

601
00:31:05,328 --> 00:31:07,728
Qachon koʻchib oʻtmoqchisiz?

602
00:31:07,751 --> 00:31:11,237
Kelgusi oyning birinchi yakshanbasida.

603
00:31:11,260 --> 00:31:13,627
Yuklar koʻpmi?

604
00:31:13,650 --> 00:31:19,823
Yoʻq, karavot ham yoʻq, televizor ham yoʻq, kam.

605
00:31:19,847 --> 00:31:22,503
Yangi mebel xarid qilasizmi?

606
00:31:22,526 --> 00:31:27,093
Ha, shu hafta oxirida xarid qilishga boraman.

607
00:31:27,116 --> 00:31:29,051
Yordam beraymi?

608
00:31:29,074 --> 00:31:30,885
Rahmat.

609
00:31:30,908 --> 00:31:33,401
Yoʻq, men oʻzim boshqara olaman.

610
00:31:33,425 --> 00:31:38,863
Shundaymi. Koʻchib oʻtganingizdan keyin tashrif buyurishim mumkinmi?

611
00:31:38,886 --> 00:31:40,919
Albatta.

612
00:31:40,942 --> 00:31:42,790
Iltimos, keling.

613
00:31:42,814 --> 00:31:45,297
Taom pishirib beraman.

614
00:31:45,320 --> 00:31:47,320
Xursandman.

615
00:31:47,343 --> 00:31:49,147
Ziyofat qilamiz!

616
00:31:49,171 --> 00:31:50,937
Yaxshi fikr.

617
00:31:50,960 --> 00:31:53,960
Mazali vino olib kelaman.

618
00:31:53,983 --> 00:31:56,550
Kutib qolaman.

619
00:31:56,573 --> 00:31:58,073
18-Sahna: Toʻfon paytida yigʻilish rejalarini oʻzgartirish

620
00:31:58,073 --> 00:32:02,640
Ertangi yigʻilish haqida gaplashmoqchimiz.

621
00:32:02,663 --> 00:32:05,556
Ha, nima deysiz?

622
00:32:05,579 --> 00:32:11,832
Ertaga toʻfon keladi, elektr poyezdi toʻxtab qolishi mumkin.

623
00:32:11,855 --> 00:32:14,347
Yangiliklarda koʻrdim.

624
00:32:14,371 --> 00:32:17,588
Katta toʻfon ekan.

625
00:32:17,612 --> 00:32:21,679
Ha, juda xavfli ekan.

626
00:32:21,702 --> 00:32:24,991
Ofisga kelish qiyin boʻladi.

627
00:32:25,014 --> 00:32:30,687
Shuning uchun ertangi yigʻilishni onlayn oʻtkazsak-chi?

628
00:32:30,711 --> 00:32:33,278
Onlaynmi?

629
00:32:33,300 --> 00:32:35,434
Yaxshi fikr.

630
00:32:35,457 --> 00:32:40,460
Hammaga uyidan qatnashish qulay va xavfsiz boʻladi.

631
00:32:40,483 --> 00:32:42,129
Ha, rost.

632
00:32:42,152 --> 00:32:45,085
Mubolagʻa qilish kerak emas.

633
00:32:45,108 --> 00:32:46,842
Rahmat.

634
00:32:46,865 --> 00:32:50,721
Yigʻilish soat 14:00 dan boshlanadi, shundaymi?

635
00:32:50,744 --> 00:32:54,358
Ha, vaqt oʻzgarmaydi.

636
00:32:54,381 --> 00:32:56,114
Tushunarli.

637
00:32:56,137 --> 00:32:58,871
Materiallar haqida nima qilamiz?

638
00:32:58,894 --> 00:33:03,331
Materiallarni bugun kechqurun elektron pochta orqali yuboraman.

639
00:33:03,354 --> 00:33:07,688
Yigʻilishdan oldin oʻqiyman, iltimos.

640
00:33:07,711 --> 00:33:11,677
Boʻlim boshligʻiga ham aytish kerakmi?

641
00:33:11,700 --> 00:33:17,519
Ha, men boʻlim boshligʻiga xabar berib qoʻyaman, xavotir olmang.

642
00:33:17,543 --> 00:33:19,143
Rahmat.

643
00:33:19,166 --> 00:33:20,844
Katta yordam boʻlar edi.

644
00:33:20,867 --> 00:33:25,001
Mijozlar bilan uchrashuv belgilangan emasmi?

645
00:33:25,024 --> 00:33:29,957
Ha, ertaga ertalab uchrashuv bor edi.

646
00:33:29,980 --> 00:33:32,313
Bekor qildingizmi?

647
00:33:32,336 --> 00:33:38,070
Ha, yomgʻir kuchli, keyingi haftaga qoldirdik.

648
00:33:38,093 --> 00:33:40,359
Yaxshi bo'ldi.

649
00:33:40,382 --> 00:33:45,077
Ertaga kun bo'yi uyda ishlayman.

650
00:33:45,101 --> 00:33:47,916
Kompyuterni uyga olib ketasizmi?

651
00:33:47,939 --> 00:33:53,232
Ha, og'ir bo'lsa ham, kerakligi uchun olib ketaman.

652
00:33:53,256 --> 00:33:55,722
Ehtiyot bo'lib keting.

653
00:33:55,745 --> 00:33:59,920
Ha, shamol kuchayishidan oldin ketaman.

654
00:33:59,944 --> 00:34:03,517
Bugun ishni erta tugataylik.

655
00:34:03,541 --> 00:34:05,589
Ha, rahmat.

656
00:34:05,612 --> 00:34:08,021
Salom.

657
00:34:08,045 --> 00:34:09,545
19-SAHNA: Kompyuter nosozligi va uning bartaraf etilishi

658
00:34:09,545 --> 00:34:11,778
Xayrli tong.

659
00:34:11,801 --> 00:34:14,134
Xayrli tong.

660
