Kechirasiz.

662
00:34:18,536 --> 00:34:22,210
Kompyuterim buzilgandek.

663
00:34:22,234 --> 00:34:23,967
Nima?

664
00:34:23,990 --> 00:34:25,857
Rostdanmi?

665
00:34:25,881 --> 00:34:27,647
Ha.

666
00:34:27,670 --> 00:34:31,670
Ertalabdan beri ekran butunlay qorong'i.

667
00:34:31,693 --> 00:34:34,627
Bu juda yomon ekan-ku.

668
00:34:34,650 --> 00:34:37,583
Elektr kiryaptimi?

669
00:34:37,606 --> 00:34:42,614
Elektr kiryapti, lekin hech narsa ko'rinmaydi.

670
00:34:42,637 --> 00:34:45,074
Muammoga duch keldik.

671
00:34:45,098 --> 00:34:50,101
Bugungi taqdimot materiallari qanday qilamiz?

672
00:34:50,124 --> 00:34:55,991
U kompyuter ichida, shuning uchun hozir olib chiqolmayman.

673
