Rahmat, juda mehribonligingiz uchun.

690
00:35:46,500 --> 00:35:50,467
Buzilgam kompyuterni ta'mirlashga berasizmi?

691
00:35:50,490 --> 00:35:52,023
Ha.

692
00:35:52,046 --> 00:35:56,328
Kompaniyaning IT bo'limiga ko'rsataman.

693
00:35:56,352 --> 00:35:59,318
Shunday qilish yaxshiroq.

694
00:35:59,341 --> 00:36:02,948
Ma'lumotlar o'chib ketmasa yaxshi bo'lardi.

695
00:36:02,972 --> 00:36:07,505
Ko'p muhim ma'lumotlar bor, shuning uchun xavotirdaman.

696
00:36:07,528 --> 00:36:09,097
Ha.

697
00:36:09,121 --> 00:36:12,654
Bundan keyin ehtiyotkorlik bilan saqlayman.

698
00:36:12,677 --> 00:36:17,334
Har kimdan xatolar bo'lishi mumkin, xafa bo'lmang.

699
00:36:17,358 --> 00:36:20,491
G'amxo'rligingiz uchun rahmat.

700
00:36:20,514 --> 00:36:24,781
Endi tezroq material tayyorlaymiz.

701
00:36:24,804 --> 00:36:26,175
Ha.

702
00:36:26,198 --> 00:36:28,053
Harakat qilaman.

703
