20-SAHNA: Dam olish kunidagi o'yin-kulgi / Dam olish kunida istirohat bog'ida

704
00:36:29,576 --> 00:36:34,344
Dam olish kunida biror qiziqarli narsa qildingizmi?

705
00:36:34,368 --> 00:36:38,539
Ha, do'stlarim bilan istirohat bog'iga bordik.

706
