Ob-havo ham yaxshi edi, shundaymi?

708
00:36:43,096 --> 00:36:49,179
Ha, iliq edi, shamol ham yo'q edi, juda zo'r edi.

709
00:36:49,202 --> 00:36:52,135
Roller-coasterga chiqdingizmi?

710
00:36:52,158 --> 00:36:53,635
Ha.

711
00:36:53,659 --> 00:36:58,192
Qo'rqinchli, lekin qiziqarli, shuning uchun uch marta chiqdim.

712
00:36:58,215 --> 00:37:00,382
Uch martami?

713
00:37:00,405 --> 00:37:02,405
Ajoyib!

714
00:37:02,428 --> 00:37:07,713
Do'stlarim roller-coasterni yaxshi ko'radi, shuning uchun birga chiqdik.

715
00:37:07,736 --> 00:37:10,302
Odamlar ko'p edi-mi?

716
00:37:10,325 --> 00:37:11,892
Ha.

717
00:37:11,915 --> 00:37:17,248
Bugungi taqdimot materiallari qanday qilamiz?

718
00:37:17,271 --> 00:37:19,328
U kompyuter ichida, shuning uchun hozir olib chiqolmayman.

719
00:37:19,352 --> 00:37:23,560
Ko'p yurganimiz uchun oyoqlarim og'riyapti.

720
00:37:23,583 --> 00:37:25,816
Charchadingiz, tabriklayman.

721
00:37:25,839 --> 00:37:29,406
Men uydan chiqmagan edim.

722
00:37:29,429 --> 00:37:32,286
Yig'ilish bugun tushdan keyin, shundaymi?

723
00:37:32,310 --> 00:37:38,077
Tozalamoqchi edim, kitob ham o‘qimoqchi edim, shuning uchun tashqariga chiqmadim.

724
00:37:38,100 --> 00:37:41,233
Yaxshi dam oldingizmi?

725
00:37:41,256 --> 00:37:44,667
Yaxshi uxladim, shuning uchun bugun yaxshiman.

726
00:37:44,690 --> 00:37:46,664
Yaxshi boʻldi-ku.

727
00:37:46,687 --> 00:37:49,354
Qanday kitob o‘qidingiz?

728
00:37:49,377 --> 00:37:52,177
Yapon tarixi haqidagi kitob.

729
00:37:52,200 --> 00:37:54,433
Qiyin emasmi?

730
00:37:54,456 --> 00:38:00,105
Kanji ko‘p bo‘lgani uchun biroz qiyin, lekin qiziqarli.

731
00:38:00,129 --> 00:38:02,462
Bilim olish mumkin ekan.

732
00:38:02,485 --> 00:38:03,704
Ha.

733
00:38:03,728 --> 00:38:08,166
Yapon tilimni yanada yaxshilamoqchiman, shuning uchun harakat qilaman.

734
00:38:08,189 --> 00:38:10,209
Ajoyib ekan!

735
00:38:10,232 --> 00:38:15,043
Keyingi dam olish kunimizda birga muzeyga boramizmi?

736
00:38:15,067 --> 00:38:17,340
Muzeyga borishmi?

737
00:38:17,363 --> 00:38:21,630
Mashhur rasmlar kelgan, shuning uchun ko‘rmoqchiman.

738
00:38:21,653 --> 00:38:23,268
Yaxshi fikr.

739
00:38:23,292 --> 00:38:27,625
Men ham rasmlarni ko‘rishni yaxshi ko‘raman, borishni xohlayman.

740
00:38:27,648 --> 00:38:30,815
Yakshanba kuni qanday?

741
00:38:30,838 --> 00:38:33,977
Stansiyaga yaqin muzey, shundaymi?

742
00:38:34,000 --> 00:38:35,467
Ha.

743
00:38:35,490 --> 00:38:39,823
Yaqin, chiroyli, juda yaxshi joy ekan.

744
00:38:39,846 --> 00:38:42,257
Kutib qolaman.